cff-version: 1.2.0
title: MAMUT-routing-TDVRPTW-Blauth2024
type: dataset
message: >-
  Cite this metadata for the MAMUT-routing conversion, validation and reference-solution publication of Blauth2024. Cite Blauth et al. (2024) and the upstream dataset for the original benchmark, and retain the geographic and traffic-data attributions specified in LICENSE. Record the exact Git commit used.
