url: "https://github.com/ANR-MAMUT/MAMUT-routing-TDVRPTW-Blauth2024"
abstract: >-
  This repository provides a MAMUT-routing conversion of the delivery-only benchmark of Blauth, Held, Müller, Schlomberg, Traub, Tröbst and Vygen (2024). The listed authors contribute conversion to the platform format, validation of travel-time and objective semantics, integration of upstream reference solutions and publication of additional solver results. The original benchmark design and instance data belong to the upstream authors. OpenStreetMap, Uber Movement and upstream publication and dataset attributions are documented in README.md and LICENSE.
